AI MODEL NOTICE
---------------
The optional on-device AI coach uses Google's Gemma open models, downloaded by
the end user at runtime. Gemma is provided under Google's own model terms:
https://ai.google.dev/gemma/terms — those terms govern the model weights, not
this license.

